<droneBlueprint name="OE_COMBAT_BIRD_MULTI_1_LASER">
	<type>COMBAT</type>
	<tip>tip_toggle_combat</tip>
	<title>Twin Drone Mk. I [Laser]</title>
	<short>Twin I [L]</short>
	<desc>[CURRENT MODE: Laser] A modification of the combat drone that attaches a secondary ion cannon to the side of the drone which fires a weak ion blast alongside it's main weapon. This ion shot can only ionize shield layers and will have no effect on hit systems. The main weapon can be switched between a Laser and Beam weapon.</desc>
	<power>2</power>
	<cooldown>1000</cooldown>
	<dodge>0</dodge>
	<speed>10</speed>
	<cost>65</cost>
	<bp>3</bp>
	<droneImage>drone_oe_bird_multi_1_l</droneImage>
	<weaponBlueprint>OE_DRONE_LASER_COMBAT_MULTI</weaponBlueprint>
	<rarity>5</rarity>
	<iconImage>combat</iconImage>
</droneBlueprint>
<droneBlueprint name="OE_COMBAT_BIRD_MULTI_1_BEAM">
	<type>COMBAT</type>
	<tip>tip_toggle_combat</tip>
